  "root_review": [
    "Read complete study, experiment plan and diagram; checked central architecture against primary Dyna reports and original figure rates.",
    "Traced current renderer: zero dynamic joints and actuators, disabled contact, direct mocap assignment, mj_forward without mj_step.",
    "Corrected R1 600 Hz to physics integration frequency; no verified servo-control frequency claimed.",
    "Separated unknown tactile routing and undisclosed Dyna-2.1 changes from documented Dyna-2 architecture.",
    "Physical grasp diagnostic is planned local work, not an original Dyna policy reproduction or completion of the full-room task."
  ],
